      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسهرهُ</span></b>  <i>He,</i> (S, Msb,) or <i>it,</i> (A,) as anxiety,
or trouble of mind, and pain, (TA,) <i>caused him
to wake, to be sleepless,</i> or <i>wakeful,</i> or <i>to remain
awake.</i> (S, A, Msb, TA.)

